units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
lattice fcc 3.52
region box block 0 10 0 10 0 10
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
pair_style eam
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Ni
mass 1 58.6934
velocity all create 600 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix 1 all npt temp 300 2500 10 iso 1.01325 1.01325 100
timestep 0.001
thermo 100
run 2200
